            <sparkle:version>242</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.81</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>While a recording is processed, the card says what is happening right now: preparing audio, transcribing, checking for missed words, cleaning up the text, identifying speakers or saving the transcript, instead of &quot;Transcribing&quot; the whole time.</li>
<li>The position knob on the player timeline has a white ring in the dark theme too, instead of a dark one.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
